{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d00a60c7bc420c5b47b575625410158fa73d7afbdfa9cfaeadd3724388959114", "ja": "（PV撮影が終わった。可愛らしいテラス席で、\n想い人を待つ、紗代子の表情が際立っていたな）", "zh": "（PV拍摄结束了。在可爱的露台座位上等待心上人的紗代子的表情格外出彩。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "e0bdb7d580cd5891935d5344f233eec0d3f0f16ddd3632c117bb27fd885b4852", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n今日の演技……どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n今天的演技……感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c88a1c2465c2802c5b2a528101d4096b2bd44ee0dbd1d2141e959d9f6433ffd2", "ja": "よかったよ！　心情を表した表情とか、\nちょっとした仕草とか。見ててグッときた。", "zh": "表现得很好！无论是表达心情的表情，\n还是一些细微的动作，都让我看得很有感触。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "15470db91fa1ddd2e7572358ada595f124f8be6c131cd97e75cb0dc8556982dd", "ja": "本当ですか……！　よかったです。\n今日に備えて、たくさん練習してきましたから。", "zh": "真的吗……！那就太好了。\n为了今天，我可是练习了很久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "42b396dcd1d188185968dc310fff92d6c200537fafe3d16c628812f456602ed5", "ja": "もちろん、どんなお仕事も全力ですよ！\nでも今日は、全力中の全力で挑んだというか……。", "zh": "当然，无论什么工作我都会全力以赴！\n不过今天该说是拿出了全力中的全力来挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b5cdbdfb3e9c951463b8b6cc3290b37061f33d349137a60628d3c8f5886ca5c9", "ja": "ははっ、大丈夫だよ。\n紗代子の誠実さは、よく知ってる。", "zh": "哈哈，没事的。\n我很了解纱代子的认真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fd37909977c1ef29476ed206daefa4e055d8b271dce3a12bddb58a8f9315af99", "ja": "確かに、いつもと違うなと思ったけど……\n何かあったのか？", "zh": "确实，我觉得你今天跟平时不太一样……\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "1d0e158e375f370ecb5f0b7259f4d3bc8d9e69314dc59f0e001c835c5e113113", "ja": "えっと……。\n理由自体は、本当にちょっとしたことなんです。", "zh": "那个……理由本身，真的只是件小事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "0e014720ad8d5a32baa91835cc1eb058d7808742d2ae042c139b4ac9a760717b", "ja": "……オーディションに落ちてばかりだった私を、\n家族は、ずっと応援してくれました。", "zh": "……家人一直都在支持着\n不断在选拔中落选的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "6e7b52efeb4c58715660f0d2607ee9dabe90cdaed301df4b3b9362ad284ecd1f", "ja": "39プロジェクトに合格した時は、ごちそうやケーキを\n用意して、すごい喜んでくれて……ふふっ。", "zh": "通过39企划的选拔时，他们还准备了\n大餐和蛋糕，特别替我高兴……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "38c3f8866ea950b161bfe8ccf749dbee177b99a86e896bd0a3f67aba32b5b2f4", "ja": "その時、お母さんが言ったんです。\n「今日は、アイドルとしての誕生日ね」って。", "zh": "那时候，妈妈对我说：\n“今天是你作为偶像的生日呢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4e2beba4b452a8ca591952ec083b20e8b60576c1d825aea23887b6af87d5166b", "ja": "アイドルの誕生日……。\nなるほど、そういう考え方もあるな。", "zh": "偶像的生日……。\n原来如此，这样想也很有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "990299eaf3910032f4006e0a6724b0316c358a5ada25466a313e25938acc4bf2", "ja": "はい、素敵ですよね♪　このお仕事の話を聞いた時、\nそのことを思い出したんです。", "zh": "是啊，很棒吧♪　听到这份工作的事情时，我就想起了那件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "c2315f12d5308f8b7dc3eb164b60ed8a422fb05fda32c8fb57e703f028930ae4", "ja": "私が、こうしてアイドルをやれてるのは……\nいつも、背中を押してくれる人たちのおかげですから！", "zh": "我能以偶像的身份站在这里……\n都是因为那些一直在背后支持我的人们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "48cd8f84c74f23639b0891a7c9973b511353abdf370591f84536f4a31a272f2d", "ja": "その人達の期待に応えるためにも、今の私のすべてで、\n素敵なPVにしようと思ったんです。", "zh": "为了回应那些人的期待，我也想用现在的全部，拍出一支精彩的PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2bf53c7dda267f2fe9b28936afb5549498600417b6f693a70ee0de5d7b1ecbd5", "ja": "そうか……。\n紗代子の思いは、PVを見た人にも伝わるよ。必ず。", "zh": "这样啊……\n纱代子的心意，也一定能传达给看PV的人。一定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "9e99042bae8a2f6a45bc8e152faf2fca3476297d1ed6de8a7faa8575c496e567", "ja": "ありがとうございます。{$P$}に\nそう言ってもらえて、安心しました！", "zh": "谢谢您。听到{$P$}\n这么说，我就放心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "5f10f5978451e4277afed3489d23ed8f073e30fbc7c86c9f23374bc47ace9d26", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}。私、\nもっとアイドルとして成長できるように頑張ります。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。我会努力，让自己作为偶像不断成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0534_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "cc21f5ed79ec3bf693b8ba47604737ff47fedf3db2533cfde042c6a672d607eb", "ja": "次の誕生日までには、今より素敵なアイドルに\nなってみせますから……私のこと、見ててくださいね♪", "zh": "到下一个生日，我一定会努力成为比现在更出色的偶像……请一直看着我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
